// {"files":[{"path":"\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\danie\\OneDrive\\github-repos\\drosemann\\README.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":11,"oldLines":6,"newStart":11,"newLines":7,"lines":[" My browser survival game stranded-horizons is the one project still on Vercel auto-deploys: https://github.com/drosemann/stranded-horizons"," On the client side I use Windows, with a nod to the games industry, and I plan to switch to Linux as soon as anticheat support gets better."," My focus is on cybersecurity, AI, cloud and virtualization, and automation with Python.","+For that Python side I built aktienwerk, which turns SEC filings and stock prices for 100 US companies into plain explanations with only the standard library and SQLite: https://github.com/drosemann/aktienwerk"," My hosting path went from Aternos to Ploudos to Minehub, which later closed."," After that it went through DeinServerHost, Strato, Host-Unlimited, LuxVPS and Mine-Hoster."," I cancelled ST-Hosting after one month because their LXC setup didn't meet my expectations, and HT-Hosting went insolvent, which taught me to migrate under time pressure."]}]}]}
